"| Oil Derivatives (Set 2, 4 time steps, 3-bit)| 84     | Optimized Real Amplitudes     | 78     | 6180              | 6350             | -3.73          | 19.13  | -4.19                  | 21.71          |\n"
"| IBEX35 (Set 3, 4 time steps, 2-bit)         | 56     | Optimized Real Amplitudes     | 96     | 3314              | 3523             | -3.67          | 14.48  | -4.11                  | 16.44          |\n"
